    "definitions": {
      "short": "something saved , i.e. (abstractly) deliverance ; hence, aid , victory , prosperity",
      "usage": "deliverance, health, help(-ing), salvation, save, saving (health), welfare.",
      "full": "H3444. yeshuah יְשׁוּעָה noun feminine salvation ; — ׳יְשׁ Psa 119:155 18 t.; יְשׁוּעָ֫תָה 3:3 ; Jonah 2:10 ; יְשֻׁעָ֫תָה Psa 80:3 ; construct יְשׁוּעַת Exod 14:13 4 t.; suffix יְשֻׁעָתִי Job 30:15 ; יְשׁוּעָתִי Psa 62:2 12 t., + 25 t. suffixes; plural יְשׁוּעוֺת 2Sam 22:51 6 t.; יְשׁוּעֹת 2Sam 42:12 3t.; יְשֻׁעוֺת 2Sam 53:7; &#8212; 1 welfare, prosperity: ישׁעתי עברה כעב Job 30:15 as a cloud my prosperity passed away. 2 deliverance: לישׁועה לי והיתה and thou wilt be to me for deliverance 2Sam 10:11 = 1Chr 19:12 . 3 salvation by God, primarily from external evils, but often with added spiritual idea: Gen 49:18 (poem), Isa 33:2 ; 52:7 , 10 ; 59:11 ; 60:18 ; Jonah 2:10 ; Psa 3:3 ; Psalm 3:9; 14:7 = Psalm 53:7; 22:2 ; 35:3 ; 62:2 ; 69:30 ; 70:5 ( = תשׁועה 40:17 ), 78:22 ; 80:3 ; 91:16 ; 96:2 = 1Chr 16:23 , Psa 106:4 ; 140:8 ; Job 13:16 ; with verbs of rejoicing בישׁועה 1Sam 2:1 ; Isa 25:9 ; Psa 9:15 ; 13:6 ; 35:9 ; חוֺמוֺת יָשִׁית יְשׁועָה Isa 26:1 salvation will he set as walls ; compare phrase ישׁ ׳אֱלֹהֵי Psa 88:2 , ישׁ ׳אֵל Isa 12:2 , ישׁ ׳צוּר Deut 32:15 (song), Psa 89:27 , compare וְישׁוּעָתִי צוּרִי 62:3 ; 62:7 ; ישׁ ׳יוֺם Isa 49:8 ; הישׁ ׳מַעַיְנֵי 12:3 wells of salvation ; plural יְשׁוּעוֺת (intensive), of ׃י מָּנַי ׳יְשׁוּעוֺת Psa 42:6 ; the salvation of my face (person; ᵑ0 פניו error, ᵑ6 ᵐ5 פני ), Psalm 42:12; 43:5 ; ישׁועות כּוֺס 116:13 cup commemorating saving acts (of drink-offering); further 119:123 ; 119:155 ; 119:166 ; 119:174 ; || צְדָקָה Isa 51:6 , 8 ; 56:1 ; 62:1 ; Psa 98:2 ; 98:3 ; הָאָרֶץ עַדקְֿצֵה יְשׁוּעָתִי Isa 49:6 my salvation unto the ends of the earth ; יְשׁוּעָתֶ֑ךָ בְּכָלאגּוֺיִם Psa 67:3 among all nations thy salvation. 4 victory: with עָשָׂה work victory 1Sam 14:45 ; Isa 26:18 : elsewhere of victories wrought by Yahweh for his people Exod 15:2 (song) Isa 12:2 ; Hab 3:8 ; Psa 20:6 ; 21:2 ; 21:6 ; 44:5 ; 68:20 ; 118:14 ; 118:15 ; 118:21 ; phrases: יְשׁוּעוֺת פעל do victories 74:12 ; יְשׁוּעֹת חֹסֶן Isa 33:6 store of victories ; יְשׁוּעוֺת מִגְדּוֺל 2Sam 22:51 Qr tower of victories (Kt מַגְדִּיל and so || Psalm 18:51); יְשׁוּעוֺת מָעוֺז Psa 28:8 stronghold of victories ; י אֶתיְֿשׁוּעַת ׳רְאוּ Exod 14:13 (J) see the victory of Yahweh , 2Chr 20:17 ; יְשׁוּעָה כּוֺבַע Isa 59:17 helmet of victory ; בִּישׁוּעָה עֲנָוִים יְפָאֵר Psa 149:4 he will beautify the meek with victory. — compare the synonym תְּשׁוּעָה below",
